        "procedure": "Er(OAc)3·6H2O (88.6 g, 0.2 mmol) was added to a stirred solution of H2ppt (47.8 mg, 0.2 mmol) with NEt3 (40.4 mg, 0.4 mol) in DMF (5 mL). The mixture was stirred overnight at room temperature to give a yellow solution, which was filtered and layered with diethyl ether. Yellow stick crystals formed after three weeks and were collected by filtration (yield 53.8%). Amounts are transcribed as printed in the SI, including the inconsistent mass/mole units.",
